        },
        {
          "text": "Abasimilyango, Akubu a-Talimoni abakwabo ibakali kulanga milyango, bakali mwanda amakumi aali musanu aabili ababili. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.11.19",
